    },
    {
      "id": "cs-16-22-p17-titanium-table",
      "type": "table",
      "page": 17,
      "label": "钛（Ti）",
      "columns": [
        "金属",
        "性质与应用"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "钛（Ti）",
          "由于其稳定的化学性质，良好的耐高温、耐低温、抗强酸、抗强碱，以及高强度、低密度的特性，被誉为“太空金属”，在航空航天、武器装备、能源、化工、冶金、建筑和交通等领域应用前景广阔。"
        ]
      ],
      "currentOfficialOverride": {
        "verifiedAt": "2026-10-25",
        "reason": "纠正单质化合物混淆、臭氧健康误导、硫酸钡溶液误称、可燃冰资源年限及塑料容器一概有毒等表述，按性质用途及条件说明。",
        "sources": [
          "https://periodic-table.rsc.org/",
          "https://www.epa.gov/indoor-air-quality-iaq/ozone-generators-are-sold-air-cleaners",
          "https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/home-business-and-entertainment-products/compact-fluorescent-lamps-cfls-fact-sheetfaq",
          "https://www.fda.gov/food/alerts-advisories-safety-information/fda-advises-consumers-not-inhale-nitrous-oxide-products",
          "https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/gas-hydrates",
          "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zljds/xfzn/art/2023/art_cf41732ce0de46f7af4e5abe3b18a339.html",
          "https://www.fda.gov/media/96185/download"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "钛（Ti）",
            "钛Ti及其合金具有较高比强度和良好耐腐蚀性，用于航空航天等领域。耐腐蚀依赖表面保护层与具体介质，不能表述为抵抗任何强酸强碱；合金性能还受成分和加工条件影响。"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-16-22-p17-iron-table",
      "type": "table",
      "page": 17,
      "label": "铁（Fe）",
      "columns": [
        "金属",
        "性质与应用"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "铁（Fe）",
          "纯铁为银白色，有金属光泽，铁粉为黑色。铁粉能和水、氧气反应生成氧化铁，可用作“双吸剂”，防止食品受潮氧化。\n钢是对含碳量质量百分比介于0.02%至2.04%之间的铁合金的统称，是用量最大、用途最广的合金"
        ]
      ],
      "currentOfficialOverride": {
        "verifiedAt": "2026-10-25",
        "reason": "纠正单质化合物混淆、臭氧健康误导、硫酸钡溶液误称、可燃冰资源年限及塑料容器一概有毒等表述，按性质用途及条件说明。",
        "sources": [
          "https://periodic-table.rsc.org/",
          "https://www.epa.gov/indoor-air-quality-iaq/ozone-generators-are-sold-air-cleaners",
          "https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/home-business-and-entertainment-products/compact-fluorescent-lamps-cfls-fact-sheetfaq",
          "https://www.fda.gov/food/alerts-advisories-safety-information/fda-advises-consumers-not-inhale-nitrous-oxide-products",
          "https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/gas-hydrates",
          "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zljds/xfzn/art/2023/art_cf41732ce0de46f7af4e5abe3b18a339.html",
          "https://www.fda.gov/media/96185/download"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "铁（Fe）",
            "纯铁常呈银白色，钢是以铁为基础并含碳及其他元素的合金，不等于纯铁。铁粉可在一定条件下消耗氧气，用于部分食品脱氧剂；反应需要湿度等条件，不能把所有铁制品都称为食品干燥剂。"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-16-22-p17-copper-table",
      "type": "table",
      "page": 17,
      "label": "铜（Cu）",
      "columns": [
        "金属",
        "性质与应用"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "铜（Cu）",
          "纯铜呈紫红色，又称紫铜或红铜，有极好的导热、导电性，是人类最早使用的金属。\n青铜是纯铜加入锌与镍以外的金属（如锡、铅或铝）所产生的合金，是金属冶铸史上最早出现的合金。古时青铜器埋在土里后颜色因氧化而呈青灰，故名青铜。"
        ]
      ],
      "currentOfficialOverride": {
        "verifiedAt": "2026-10-25",
        "reason": "纠正单质化合物混淆、臭氧健康误导、硫酸钡溶液误称、可燃冰资源年限及塑料容器一概有毒等表述，按性质用途及条件说明。",
        "sources": [
          "https://periodic-table.rsc.org/",
          "https://www.epa.gov/indoor-air-quality-iaq/ozone-generators-are-sold-air-cleaners",
          "https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/home-business-and-entertainment-products/compact-fluorescent-lamps-cfls-fact-sheetfaq",
          "https://www.fda.gov/food/alerts-advisories-safety-information/fda-advises-consumers-not-inhale-nitrous-oxide-products",
          "https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/gas-hydrates",
          "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zljds/xfzn/art/2023/art_cf41732ce0de46f7af4e5abe3b18a339.html",
          "https://www.fda.gov/media/96185/download"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "铜（Cu）",
            "纯铜呈紫红色，导电、导热性能良好。青铜常见为铜锡等合金，黄铜为铜锌合金；青铜器表面绿色锈层不等于新制合金本来就是绿色，颜色随成分与腐蚀状态变化。"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-16-22-p17-mercury-table",
      "type": "table",
      "page": 17,
      "label": "汞（Hg）",
      "columns": [
        "金属",
        "性质与应用"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "汞（Hg）",
          "俗称水银，在常温常压下以液态存在，是熔点最低的金属，易挥发，其蒸气和化合物多有剧毒。"
        ]
      ],
      "currentOfficialOverride": {
        "verifiedAt": "2026-10-25",
        "reason": "纠正单质化合物混淆、臭氧健康误导、硫酸钡溶液误称、可燃冰资源年限及塑料容器一概有毒等表述，按性质用途及条件说明。",
        "sources": [
          "https://periodic-table.rsc.org/",
          "https://www.epa.gov/indoor-air-quality-iaq/ozone-generators-are-sold-air-cleaners",
          "https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/home-business-and-entertainment-products/compact-fluorescent-lamps-cfls-fact-sheetfaq",
          "https://www.fda.gov/food/alerts-advisories-safety-information/fda-advises-consumers-not-inhale-nitrous-oxide-products",
          "https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/gas-hydrates",
          "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zljds/xfzn/art/2023/art_cf41732ce0de46f7af4e5abe3b18a339.html",
          "https://www.fda.gov/media/96185/download"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "汞（Hg）",
            "汞Hg俗称水银，常温常压下为液态金属，能挥发，汞蒸气及许多汞化合物有毒。液态外观不能使它成为水，化学性质与普通水或金属固体的印象不同。"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-16-22-p17-metal-extremes-table",
      "type": "table",
      "page": 17,
      "label": "金属之最",
      "columns": [
        "金属",
        "性质与应用"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "金属之最",
          "银：有最好的导电性、导热性　铂：有最好的延性\n金：有最好的展性　钨：有最高的熔点\n汞：有最低的熔点　锇：有最大的密度\n锂：有最小的密度　铬：有最高的硬度\n铯：有最低的硬度"
        ]
      ],
      "currentOfficialOverride": {
        "verifiedAt": "2026-10-25",
        "reason": "纠正单质化合物混淆、臭氧健康误导、硫酸钡溶液误称、可燃冰资源年限及塑料容器一概有毒等表述，按性质用途及条件说明。",
        "sources": [
          "https://periodic-table.rsc.org/",
          "https://www.epa.gov/indoor-air-quality-iaq/ozone-generators-are-sold-air-cleaners",
          "https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/home-business-and-entertainment-products/compact-fluorescent-lamps-cfls-fact-sheetfaq",
          "https://www.fda.gov/food/alerts-advisories-safety-information/fda-advises-consumers-not-inhale-nitrous-oxide-products",
          "https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/gas-hydrates",
          "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zljds/xfzn/art/2023/art_cf41732ce0de46f7af4e5abe3b18a339.html",
          "https://www.fda.gov/media/96185/download"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "金属之最",
            "比较金属性质必须限定纯度、温度、压力等条件。常见纯金属中，银导电性很强，钨熔点很高，锂密度很低，汞常温呈液态；导电性、硬度、密度和延展性是不同指标，不能由一个称号推出其他性质。"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
